    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 9 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> None<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Roomy<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Craft</p><p>Storage for alchemical supplies and workspaces for making all kinds of concoctions.</p><p><strong>Craft Options.</strong> When you issue the Craft order to this facility, choose one of the following.</p><p><strong>Craft: Alchemist's Supplies.</strong> The hireling crafts anything that can be made with Alchemist's Supplies, using the crafting rules of the Player's Handbook and Dungeon Master's Guide.</p><p><strong>Craft: Poison.</strong> The hireling crafts a vial of one application of Burnt Othur Fumes, Essence of Ether, or Torpor in 7 days; you pay half the cost of the poison.</p>",
